177
00:10:57,049 --> 00:11:01,620
Usse bhi zyada der hui, toh faisla bank ki policy par.

178
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:05,782
Toh pehle ghante mein kya karna hai? Pehla,

179
00:11:05,782 --> 00:11:09,423
turant cyber fraud helpline par call karo,

180
00:11:09,423 --> 00:11:12,545
ya cybercrime portal par shikayat. Doosra,

181
00:11:12,545 --> 00:11:17,227
